  "minorAccountReviewRestrictionEngagement": "Comments, likes, reposts, and follows are paused",
  "minorAccountReviewRestrictionMessaging": "Starting or replying to regular messages is paused",
  "minorAccountReviewRestrictionSupport": "Support and your moderation message remain available",
  "minorAccountReviewContentTitle": "What happens to your videos",
  "@minorAccountReviewContentTitle": {"description": "Heading that explains how a restricted minor's existing videos are handled during and after review."},
  "minorAccountReviewContentBody": "Your videos are hidden while this review is open. If your account is cleared, they come back. If the review closes without a response, your account is closed and your videos are deleted.",
